---
title: M10 Implemented parse-once and method-enabled render success path
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant T as Template
    participant S as Schema validation
    participant R as Render engine
    participant M as MethodRegistry
    participant O as Private output
    C->>T: parse / parse_with_limits(source)
    T->>T: Check limits and parse bounded AST
    T-->>C: Reusable Template
    C->>T: render_with_methods(Value, Schema, registry)
    T->>S: Validate schema and context
    S-->>T: Remaining work budget
    T->>R: Preflight every branch
    R->>M: Check names, arity and known types
    Note over R,M: No callbacks during preflight.<br/>Dynamic result types checked later.
    Note over C,R: Absent optional receiver skips chain.<br/>Argument paths use context, not prior result.
    R->>R: Resolve receiver and arguments
    R->>M: Call each method with current Value and args
    M->>M: Builtin or explicit trusted callback
    M->>M: Validate returned value and limits
    M-->>R: Result Value or typed error
    Note over R,M: Repeat for each chain link.<br/>Callback code cannot be preempted.
    R->>R: Use result for section or interpolation
    R->>O: Append text and escape scalar once unless raw
    O->>O: Enforce final output-byte limit
    O-->>R: Complete string
    R-->>T: Complete string
    T-->>C: String or TemplateError
    Note over C,O: Failures return no partial document.<br/>No rollback of trusted callback effects.
